OL,3,ARejecting closer EU ties would be
OL,4,Adereliction of duty, PM to say
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister is expected to tell
OL,7,Fthe Commons later it would be a
OL,8,F"dereliction of duty" to turn down a
OL,9,Fcloser relationship with the European
OL,10,FUnion - if one can be negotiated with
OL,11,FBrussels.
OL,13,FIn a statement to MPs on Monday, Andy
OL,14,FBurnham will argue it is time to "face
OL,15,Fup to the reality that Brexit has done
OL,16,Fmore harm than good" and "the status
OL,17,Fquo is not good enough for Britain."
OL,19,FHe first pledged to explore closer ties
OL,20,Fwith the bloc at a UK-EU summit later
OL,21,Fthis year at the Labour Party
OL,22,Fconference last month.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
