OL,3,ARejecting closer EU ties would be
OL,4,Adereliction of duty, PM to say
OL,5,
OL,6,FAddressing the Commons, Burnham is
OL,7,Fexpected to say that a new deal with
OL,8,Fthe EU could help tackle illegal
OL,9,Fimmigration and boost economic growth.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
