OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AHealey faces #35bn Budget challenge to
OL,4,Ameet spending pledges, says think tank
OL,5,
OL,6,FHigher inflation, caused by the Iran
OL,7,Fwar, could eat into what the government
OL,8,Fhoped to spend on public services,
OL,9,Fmeaning Healey will have to choose
OL,10,Fbetween spending cuts, tax rises, or a
OL,11,Fmixture of both, the IFS said.
OL,13,FThe Treasury declined to comment.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
